LC 1480: Running Sum of 1d Array
Pattern:Prefix Sum

Easy Algorithm:

Add the current number to the previous sum.

Example / Dry Run:

[1,2,3,4]

1 → 1
1+2 → 3
3+3 → 6
6+4 → 10

Answer: [1,3,6,10] ✅

CODE:

class Solution {
public:
    vector<int> runningSum(vector<int>& a) {
        for (int i = 1; i < a.size(); i++)
            a[i] += a[i-1];
        return a;
    }
};


















